          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Made in the United States",
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "166188972623ea1471-1": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Approximately <strong>only 2% of clothing is genuinely made<\/strong> in the USA. A loophole allows people to make products overseas and do slight finishing here in the United States to meet the minimum requirement to claim \"MADE IN THE USA.\" We are proud to say our luxury clothing is made in the USA.<\/p>",
            "text_style": "body"
          }
        },
