          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Minimal Waste Packaging",
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "1661892598814c9a9f-1": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Since we are an environmentally-conscious clothing brand, we believe in as little waste as possible and use zero plastic. All orders are packaged inside recycled materials and shipped in a recycled box (toss it in the recycling after you've opened it!) There are no tags on any of our products.<\/p>",
            "text_style": "body"
          }
        },
