        "16618930934317c33e-0": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Machine Wash & Dry",
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "16618930934317c33e-1": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>All Bleusalt garments are machine washable and do not shrink.  Our dyes are OEKO-TEX Certified, composed of 95% reactive and 5% disperse dye.<\/p><p><strong>For best results: <\/strong><br\/>Wash: <em>Set on delicate. Turn garment inside out prior to washing. <\/em><br\/>Dry: <em>Set on delicate. <\/em><\/p>",
            "text_style": "body"
          }
        },
