        "text_EJzbVC": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We're excited to introduce BLEUSALT LITE.  The same luxurious fabric you've come to know but in a lighter, breezier feel for warmer weather.  Engineered to produce an exceptionaly soft hand.  The drape is gorgeous, it's extremely durable and breathable and can be machine washed & dried without sacrificing color or texture. <\/p><p>LITE: 92% Micro Modal \/ 8% Spandex<\/p><p><strong>For best results: <\/strong><br\/>Wash: <em>Set on delicate. Turn garment inside out prior to washing. <\/em><br\/>Dry: <em>Set on delicate. <\/em><\/p>",
            "text_style": "body"
          }
        }
