          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "BLEUSALT LUXE",
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "text_WAUAnc": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Just like the word itself, LUXE is what describes our new creation of the softest pieces that is sure to elevate your look. The super soft inside insure to keep you warm and cozy while looking polished and elevated on the outside.  Luxe pairs well with all the other BLEUSALT® styles and mixing Regular and Lite works well to create a truly luxurious capsule wardrobe that can take you day to night and anywhere in between.  <\/p><p>LUXE: 95% Modal \/ 5% Spandex<\/p><p><strong>For best results: <\/strong><br\/>Wash: <em>Set on delicate. Turn garment inside out prior to washing. <\/em><br\/>Dry: <em>Set on delicate. <\/em><\/p>",
            "text_style": "body"
